{ White to play, does white want to trade the queens? } { [%csl Rf8][%cal Rd8f8] }
1. Qxf8+ (1. Qd5+ Qf7 (1... Kh8 2. Ra8) 2. Ra8# { The other way of winning by attacking instead of trading.
The problem with trading is players can tunnel vision on making trades while ignoring possible tactics that may arise out of the position. }) 1... Kxf8 2. Re1 { One way of winning after trading, block the king, run the pawn down and make a queen. } { The answer to the initial question as it turns out is... we can do either. } { [%cal Gb2b8,Re1e8] } *


